UPDATE `tournament_match_summaries`
SET `summary` = 'Game 1: Black Elbaf Monkey.D.Luffy wins. Luffy goes second and curves Usopp into Saul and Loki with Elbaf two-drops, pressuring life and building 12-cost blockers. Robin ramps with Brûlée, Yamato, and leader triggers into 10-cost Big Mom, but has no DON left for Gung-Gum Giant. Luffy takes the window before Robin can defend and wins with large attacks.

Game 2: Nico Robin wins. Robin stabilizes with Strusen, Brûlée, and trigger bodies, reaches 10 DON for Big Mom, then chains Perospero, Sweet 3 Generals, and Oven into repeated 8k threats and life gain. Luffy stumbles after a Gerd discard with no valid Ground Death target and mismanages pressure into the board. Robin survives the race with Gung-Gum Giant and counter, then wins on the backswing.

Game 3: Nico Robin wins. Luffy goes second, develops Usopp, Saul, double Loki, Gerd, and Rodo into a blocker wall and threatens lethal with repeated 8k attacks. Robin repeatedly heals with Big Mom, Sweet 3 Generals, and Perospero, converting triggers into attackers. Luffy attacks life instead of clearing Robin’s board and uses Loki to attack rather than block, giving Robin time to resolve a second Big Mom. Robin counters Luffy’s final attacks with a large hand and Gung-Gum Giant, then closes with Big Mom and 8k attackers.'
WHERE `id` = 'utrecht-2026-semi-robin-black-luffy';
